		"description": "<p>Beginning at 15th level, your stronghold flourishes under your knowledge and tutelage. Your stronghold increases to a Grade 5.</p><p>Additionally, you leverage your local fame and knowledge of supply lines to minimize the costs of repairs and upgrades to your structure. If you wish to add a sub-stronghold onto your stronghold (such as adding a library to your castle or a tavern to your guildhall), the cost for adding that sub-stronghold is halved.</p>",
